<!DOCTYPE html>
<head>
  <link href="/css/GenericTheme.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <title>My account</title>
  <style>
      * body{
          overflow-y:scroll;
          overflow-x: hidden;
      }

      .menu-button {
          color: white;
      }
  </style>

</head>
<body>
<header>
  <section class="header-bar">
      <nav>
      <ul>
          <li><a href="/user/homepage" class="smooth-link">Dashboard</a></li>
          <li><a href="/user/shop" class="smooth-link">Bean Shop</a></li>
          <% if session[:userId] != 1 %>
            <li><a href="/user/coffeeshop" class="smooth-link"> Coffee Shop</a></li>
            <li><a href="/user/orders" class="smooth-link">Orders</a></li>
            <li><a href="/user/settings" class="smooth-link">Settings</a></li>
          <% end %>
          <li><a href="/user/contact_us_page" class="smooth-link">Contact Us</a></li>
          <li><a href="/logout" class="smooth-link">Logout<a/></li>
      </ul>
      </nav>
  </section>
</header>
<main>
  <div style="display: grid;grid-template-columns: 20vw 80vw;">
    <div style="background-color: rgb(130 72 24); height: 100vh; box-shadow: 11px 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); z-index: 100;">

      <h1 style="text-align: center;padding: 40px 0px;">Welcome, <%= session[:uname] %>! </h1>
    </div>

    <div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); height: 100vh;">
      <img src="/imgs/dashboard.png" alt="Dashboard" style="width: 100%;height: 100%;object-fit: fill;"></a>

      <div style="display: flex;flex-direction: row;flex-wrap: wrap;justify-content: center;gap: 32px;height: 85vh;position: absolute;top: 10vh; overflow-y: scroll;">
        <div style="color: black;background: transparent;backdrop-filter: blur(15px);box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px 0px #0000007a;border-radius: 30px; text-align: center;width:35vw;">
          <h1> Loyalty points</h1>
          <p style="position:relative;top:12vh;font-size: xx-large;"><%= Users.get_loyalty_points(session[:userId]) %></p>
        </div>

        <div style="color: black;background: transparent;backdrop-filter: blur(15px);box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px 0px #0000007a;border-radius: 30px; text-align: center;width:35vw;">
          <div style="font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 20px auto; color: #333; line-height: 1.6;">
            
            <h2>History of BBC</h2>
            
            <p>
              Badly Brewed Coffee (BBC) was founded on a simple mission: to bring the "Wild Side" of coffee to the everyday drinker. Our story began in the rugged highlands of Mexico, where we discovered the <strong>JorgeBean</strong>—a rare variety that thrives in the untamed rainforest rather than on a traditional farm.
            </p>
            
            <p>
              We hand-collect these beans from their natural habitat and bring them back for a specialized process we call "The Cracking." Instead of standard industrial roasting, we carefully fracture the sun-dried husks to access the raw green coffee inside. This unique method ensures that the intense, authentic flavors of the high-altitude harvest are preserved in every cup.
            </p>

            <hr>

            <h2>Our Products</h2>
            
            <p>
              Our flagship <strong>Mexican JorgeBean (£12.99)</strong> is harvested directly from the wild for a rich, deep flavor. For those needing a bold, high-acidity roast, the <strong>Kenyan AA (£10.99)</strong> is designed for a strong start to your morning. If you prefer a smooth, complex cup, the <strong>Guatemalan Antigua (£7.99)</strong> offers a taste of pure nostalgia.
            </p>

            <p>
              For the more adventurous, the earthy <strong>Amazonian Blend (£6.59)</strong> makes you feel the river flow in every sip. We also offer the <strong>Ethiopian Yirgacheffe (£4.99)</strong>, which is bright and floral, filled with joy and flavor. Finally, our <strong>Colombian Supremo (£3.99)</strong> remains a classic, dependable choice for an authentic Colombian taste.
            </p>

            <p><em>All items are available for purchase in quantities of up to 10 units.</em></p>

          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="color: black; background: transparent;backdrop-filter: blur(15px);box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px 0px #0000007a;border-radius: 30px; text-align: center;width:72vw;">
          
          <style>
            table > tr > td {
              text-align: left;
            }
          </style>
          
          <h1>Discounts / Recent Transactions</h1>
          <table style="width: 100%; overflow-y: scroll; color: black !important;">
            <tr style="display: flex; flex-direction: row; justify-content: space-evenly;">
              <td>Items</td>
              <td>Date</td>
              <td>Price</td>
            </tr>
            
            <% if @shown_orders&.any? %>
              <% @shown_orders.each do |order| %>
                <tr style="display: flex; flex-direction: row; justify-content: space-evenly;">
                  <td><%= order.UserId %></td>
                  <td><%= order.TransactionDate %></td>
                  <td>£<%= order.TotalCost %></td>
                </tr>
              <% end %>
            <% else %>
              <tr><td colspan="3" style="text-align:center; color:black;">No past transactions.</td></tr>
            <% end %>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
<footer>

</footer>
</body>